OL,3,GNEWSARam sales go ahead despite
OL,4,Abluetongue disease restrictions nearby
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Border Union Agricultural Society
OL,7,Fsaid it was creating logistical
OL,8,Fchallenges for some breeders but strong
OL,9,Fentries - up 9% on last year - meant it
OL,10,Fwould still be a major day for sheep
OL,11,Ffarming.
